  "releaseNotes": "Veil v1.8.0\n\n- Sync phnt to 4caaec5412c3ae4db8d9af28add50dfbcab8c94b\n- ALPC: add disconnect/message/cancel/impersonate flag enums, direct/work-on-behalf attributes, register callback\n- AppPackage: fix enum names with leading underscore prefix\n- ConfigurationManager: add KEY_SET_DEBUG_INFORMATION struct\n- Debug: update CreateDebugObject parameter annotations (PCOBJECT_ATTRIBUTES)\n- IOManager: add DOS_MAX_PATH_LENGTH guard, FILE_ATTRIBUTE_*, FILE_TIMESTAMP_* macros\n- KernelCore: add NtQueryDebugFilterState/NtSetDebugFilterState with Zw pairs\n- Loader: add LDR_PATCH_TABLE, LDRP_PATCHED_BINARY/HOT_PATCHED flags, LDR_SEARCH_DEFAULT_DIRS\n- ObjectManager: align OBJECT_INFORMATION_CLASS enum comments, add ObjectSetRefTraceInformation\n- PNP: add NtGetPlugPlayEvent/ZwGetPlugPlayEvent (pre-Win8)\n- PowerManager: rename SYSTEM_POWER_SETTING_VALUE to SET_POWER_SETTING_VALUE_INPUT\n- Prefetcher: restructure PF_RETRIEVE_TRACE/PF_START_TRACE_CONTROL/PF_ACCESS_TRACING_CONTROL/PF_ROBUSTNESS_CONTROL, add PF_PREFETCH_REQUEST and related structs\n- Process: add PS_PROCESS_START_ROUTINE, WER_REGISTRATION_DATA, PROCESS_*_FLAGS structs, ARM context macros, PROCESS_MITIGATION_ACTIVATION_CONTEXT_TRUST_POLICY2\n- RuntimeLibrary: add CSR_SUBSYSTEM_ID enum and CsrClientConnectToServer/CsrClientCallServer/CsrCaptureMessage/CsrIdentifyAlertable/CsrSetPriorityClass\n- Extract update workflow to veil-update skill\n- Fix ConfigurationManager.h header comment BOM whitespace",
